## Tópicos Prioritários para Expansão (v16+)

### Alta Prioridade — Faltando ou Incompletos

- Standalone Components (lifecycle completo, migration de módulos)
- Built-in Control Flow (@if, @for, @switch, @defer)
- Signal Inputs / Signal Outputs / Signal Queries
- Novo inject() function vs constructor injection
- Functional Guards e Resolvers
- Functional Interceptors (withInterceptors)
- linkedSignal e Resource API
- toSignal() e toObservable() (interop RxJS ↔ Signals)
- DestroyRef e takeUntilDestroyed
- Zoneless Angular
- Angular CLI Builders e Schematics
- ESBuild / Vite como bundler padrão (v17+)
- Server-Side Rendering com @angular/ssr (novo pacote v17+)
- Hydration (v16+)
- View Transitions API

### Média Prioridade — Existem mas precisam de profundidade

- Signals (expandir: effect, computed, untracked, signal equality)
- NgRx (expandir: NgRx SignalStore, componentStore)
- Testes (expandir: testing signals, testing standalone components)
- Rotas (expandir: functional guards, router events, preloading strategies)
- Formulários (expandir: typed forms v14+, validação avançada)

